  "findings": [
    {
      "findingId": "sol-confirmed-2ddbce75ccee1def",
      "material": true,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "The packet identifies 32 affected baseline items. All 41 baseline items were reconciled: 2 artifact/not_applicable, 10 missing_from_source/accurately_unavailable, 9 variant_match/accurately_unavailable, 12 variant_match/mismatch, and 8 exact_match/mismatch."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-confirmed-65c39911adf4fc5d",
      "material": true,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "The official menu index exposes six named menu surfaces and explicitly warns that plat du jour and weekend specials may be unlisted. Consequently, source absence cannot establish removals, a complete current catalog, allergen negatives, or cross-contact conclusions."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-confirmed-db6ad04d19ec8609",
      "material": true,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "The restaurant directly links the Toast catalog. Toast currently shows 23 presentations representing 20 unique products; its descriptions are restaurant_linked_vendor evidence and support only narrow explicit or unavoidable positive ingredients, not complete allergen arrays or negatives."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-confirmed-eda7608986fde4f0",
      "material": true,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "Baseline rows sourced from Toast are improperly classified as official-ingredients. Their valid explicit positives should be retained while their authority is downgraded to restaurant_linked_vendor and their arrays remain partial-positive-only."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-confirmed-0a92c04a49e8053c",
      "material": true,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
