    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-confirmed-69b0ead0cc4a9cf3",
      "material": true,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "The multi-service, PDF/image, non-exact-reconciliation, parser/repair, low-completeness, and scout-risk gates appropriately required strong review. Count drift is a valid screening signal only; it does not prove product removal because the accessible Toast catalog is not exhaustive."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Accepted by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-rejected-713b06e9fba688cb",
      "material": false,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "Reject any blanket conclusion that official PDF-derived ingredient evidence lacks restaurant-issued authority merely because the PDFs could not be extracted during this review. The official menu index establishes that the linked PDFs are restaurant-issued; extraction failure prevents revalidation of their contents but does not automatically downgrade their authority."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Rejected by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
      "findingId": "sol-rejected-4fbbd680898c662b",
      "material": false,
      "firstDiscoveredStage": "sol",
      "stageFindingIds": {
        "luna": [],
        "terra": [],
        "sol": [
          "Reject the deterministic duplicatePresentationCount of 20 as an evidence-backed duplicate count. The reopened Toast page shows three repeated presentations—Bistro Burger, Salade Maison, and Steak Frites—across 23 presentations and 20 unique products."
        ]
      },
      "expectedGateIds": [],
      "resolution": "Rejected by the Sol-medium coordinator review."
    },
    {
